# Third-party notice

`shopee/1_shopee_popup_v2.2.txt` and `shopee/2_shopee_daftar_v3.txt` derive from
the **Shopee Financial Tracker** userscript by **Ryu-Sena** (IndoTech Community),
originally published on Greasyfork under the MIT License.

The original copyright notice is retained in the userscript metadata headers.

Substantial modifications in this repository:

- repaired dead CSS-module selectors (7 of 8 had rotated away)
- replaced the fixed 5-second sleep with content polling (30s → ~1s per order)
- replaced the popup-per-order loop with a same-origin iframe, because popup
  blockers kill `window.open` after the first `await`
- added `localStorage` caching with version stamping to prevent stale-data
  poisoning
- removed the upstream `@updateURL` / `@downloadURL` so Tampermonkey cannot
  silently replace the patched script
- removed the unused `GM_xmlhttpRequest` grant (least privilege)

